    <img class="phone-shot" src="/blog/group-phone.webp" alt="A finished fake WhatsApp group chat with group events, coloured sender names, reactions and a member count" loading="lazy" width="540" height="1170" />
    <figcaption>The finished group chat — events, coloured names, reactions and read receipts.</figcaption>
